WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.036 --> 00:00:08.471
"Wow! A raccoon!" Ezra said.

2
00:00:08.472 --> 00:00:12.517
"Hey, that's my candy!" Glen yelled.

3
00:00:12.518 --> 00:00:16.439
"Oops. I must have dropped some," Ivy said.

4
00:00:16.440 --> 00:00:20.629
The kids watched in amazement as the raccoon tore off the wrapper.

5
00:00:20.630 --> 00:00:26.348
Then it ate the candy and ran off into the woods.

6
00:00:26.349 --> 00:00:36.129
Ivy started laughing. "The raccoon was probably the candy thief in your cabin too!"

7
00:00:36.130 --> 00:00:39.423
Glen ran and grabbed the wrapper.

8
00:00:39.424 --> 00:00:43.559
"I always knew it was a raccoon that broke into the cabin.

9
00:00:43.560 --> 00:00:48.059
I could tell right away from how the screen was torn open."

10
00:00:48.060 --> 00:00:56.107
Ezra's eyes narrowed. "If you knew it was a raccoon, why didn't you tell us?"

11
00:00:56.108 --> 00:01:03.845
"Um . . ." Glen laughed. "I guess I forgot to mention it."

12
00:01:03.846 --> 00:01:07.069
"Too bad it wasn't a bear," Ivy said.

13
00:01:07.070 --> 00:01:10.893
"Do you think a bear could eat all three Ucks?

14
00:01:10.894 --> 00:01:15.909
Probably not, because Ucks taste yucky!"

15
00:01:15.910 --> 00:01:25.379
The friends laughed as they walked to the lodge for lunch.

16
00:01:25.380 --> 00:01:33.007
*** After lunch, Private announced that everyone should report to the tennis

17
00:01:33.008 --> 00:01:37.293
courts. The campers picked up balls and rackets from the equipment

18
00:01:37.294 --> 00:01:41.399
shed. Then they started toward the

19
00:01:41.400 --> 00:01:43.681
courts. Ivy suddenly stopped

20
00:01:43.682 --> 00:01:47.665
walking. "Wait, first a baseball game in the hot

21
00:01:47.666 --> 00:01:51.931
sun. And now there are tennis matches all

22
00:01:51.932 --> 00:01:55.879
afternoon?" She shook her head. "I'm not

23
00:01:55.880 --> 00:01:59.751
going." "You have to go." Glen waved his

24
00:01:59.752 --> 00:02:05.053
racket. "I can't wait to show my Evergreen spirit on the tennis

25
00:02:05.054 --> 00:02:10.257
court!" "I can barely stand one sport per day," Ivy

26
00:02:10.258 --> 00:02:14.481
said. "I'll skip tennis and think about ways to get back at the

27
00:02:14.482 --> 00:02:21.673
Ucks." "We're not allowed to skip activities," Ezra said. "What if you get in

28
00:02:21.674 --> 00:02:27.542
trouble?" "I won't get in trouble if I don't get

29
00:02:27.543 --> 00:02:34.130
caught." Ivy put a finger to her lips and slipped behind the shed, out of

30
00:02:34.131 --> 00:02:39.765
sight. Once everyone had left for tennis, Ivy checked to make sure she was alone.

31
00:02:39.766 --> 00:02:44.048
Then she took her sketch pad and sat under a big tree.

32
00:02:44.049 --> 00:02:50.825
Ivy leaned against the tree trunk, opened the sketch pad, and started to draw.

33
00:02:50.826 --> 00:02:56.169
It was a great way to spend the afternoon, but suddenly she heard voices.

34
00:02:56.170 --> 00:03:00.067
She looked up to see Mango and Larry coming her way.

35
00:03:00.068 --> 00:03:04.233
They were talking together, so they hadn't seen her.

36
00:03:04.234 --> 00:03:07.513
Ivy ducked behind the tree to hide.

37
00:03:07.514 --> 00:03:12.919
"Mrs. Matsak wants us to move the bear statue tonight," Mango was saying.

38
00:03:12.920 --> 00:03:17.211
"It needs to be in the square for the big ceremony tomorrow morning.

39
00:03:17.212 --> 00:03:22.939
The statue is so lifelike—a masterpiece of nature art!"

40
00:03:22.940 --> 00:03:28.170
"You mean, we have to, like, move that big thing?" Larry asked.

41
00:03:28.171 --> 00:03:31.783
"Isn't it, like, really heavy?"

42
00:03:31.784 --> 00:03:35.665
Mango shrugged. "It's probably no big deal.

43
00:03:35.666 --> 00:03:38.250
And it won't take us very long.

44
00:03:38.251 --> 00:03:43.717
When we're done, we can chill out . . . watch the stars or something."

45
00:03:43.718 --> 00:03:49.352
The two counselors walked past the tree and were soon out of sight.

46
00:03:49.353 --> 00:03:54.411
Ivy peeked around the tree with a thoughtful look on her face.

47
00:03:54.412 --> 00:03:59.097
Then she smiled and started drawing again.

48
00:03:59.098 --> 00:04:04.733
Ivy was still under the tree when Ezra and Glen returned from tennis.

49
00:04:04.734 --> 00:04:10.858
"Gross. You guys look hot and sweaty. How was tennis?"

50
00:04:10.859 --> 00:04:18.161
Ezra sat down beside her. "I only got called Snuggy Wuggy 15 times."

51
00:04:18.162 --> 00:04:23.985
Ivy noticed a red mark on Glen's forehead. "What happened to you?"

52
00:04:23.986 --> 00:04:32.254
Glen rubbed his forehead. "Huck hit me with his serve."

53
00:04:32.255 --> 00:04:36.204
"I had a much better time than you did," Ivy said.

54
00:04:36.205 --> 00:04:39.554
"I've figured out a way to scare the Ucks!"

55
00:04:39.555 --> 00:04:43.352
She held up her sketch pad to show them her drawing.

56
00:04:43.353 --> 00:04:45.945
"Here's what we're going to do . . ."

